  "body": "Located within the esteemed and award-winning master planned community of Kensington Park Orewa, The Gardens Apartments present the newest addition to luxury living.\r\n\r\n189 Hibiscus Drive stands out as the ultimate choice for entertainers. Boasting a floor area of approx. 126sqm and a deck area of approx. 29sqm, this residence provides ample room for hosting guests and basking in the warm sunshine. The thoughtful design showcases exceptional quality and encompasses three spacious bedrooms, each with its own private balcony, two generous bathrooms, a designer kitchen, and an open-plan living area. The master suite is luxuriously proportioned and features a walk-through wardrobe and a stunning fully-tiled bathroom with modern finishes.\r\n\r\nWith your purchase of this apartment, you will enjoy a range of valuable features, including three secure car parks accompanied by a storage locker. The kitchen comes equipped with Miele appliances, including an induction cooktop, electric wall oven, and full-sized dishwasher. A modern waterfall benchtop adds a touch of sophistication, while stylish feature lighting and generous stud heights enhance the overall aesthetic. Other comforts include under tile heating in the bathrooms, a heat pump, and a front-door intercom, among other impressive elements.\r\n\r\nAs a resident, you will have access to an array of community amenities designed to enrich your lifestyle. Take advantage of the heated indoor swimming pool, fully-equipped gym, and sauna. Immerse yourself in the extensive gardens, complete with scenic walking tracks through native bush, or stroll the sands of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nViewing is available Wednesday to Sunday, 10am to 2pm from our Sales Suite, 1 Parkside Drive, Orewa.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you soon.",
